{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game transports players into a charming treasure-hunting world, with beautiful graphics, vivid colors, and scenes featuring lush green lawns, colorful flowers, melodious piano music, and a joyful playground. Players take on the role of a brave explorer, navigating through the environment using the ASDW keys for movement and the space bar for jumping, exploring every nook and cranny. In the game, players must search for hidden treasures within these picturesque settings, earning points for each item found. The background music is cheerful and pleasant, whether it\u2019s the piano tunes or the laughter from the playground, creating a relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere. This is not just a treasure hunt but also a delightful relaxation and enjoyment for the soul.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740040?t=1748519007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740040?t=1748519007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740040/f06163fcb1704d2316ea8fb713ca80c3eb4d5261/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748519007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740040/f06163fcb1704d2316ea8fb713ca80c3eb4d5261/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748519007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game transports players into a charming treasure-hunting world, with beautiful graphics, vivid colors, and scenes featuring lush green lawns, colorful flowers, melodious piano music, and a joyful playground. Players take on the role of a brave explorer, navigating through the environment using the ASDW keys for movement and the space bar for jumping, exploring every nook and cranny. In the game, players must search for hidden tre